<title>USA: Professional Dental Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>Professional Dental Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>BATESVILLE, Ariz. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p> Shr			    nil		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			     10			 79</p>
<p> Revs			 5,200		    5,500</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS ENDED JULY 31</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.01		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			    169			207</p>
<p> Revs			16,400		   18,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Professional Dental Technologies Inc.  </p>
<p>NOTE: The company said third quarter results included a charge to pre-tax earnings of $182,000, which has been reserved for an anticipated writeoff at year-end for obsolete and slow inventory.  At quarter-end this reserve stood at $247,000, the remaining $65,000 having been set aside during the first and second quarters.</p>
